=3 Notes
* King Goldemar is a Black Mage, and as such he can cast tier 3-ga spells. He can also cast ancient magic, and sleepga.
* King Goldemar has an EXTREMELY fast casting rate.
* King Goldemar is very resistant to all enfeebles, including Dispel. (But not Finale)
* Throughout the fight King Goldemar will call in the animated weapons one by one. He will announce in say when he is calling a weapon, and will say exactly which weapon is coming.
* King Goldemar will use regular {p:dvergr|Dvergr} weaponskills. __(verification needed)__ Which are the following:
** **Cackle**: AoE Magic Attack Down, Magic Defense Down, Magic Accuracy Down. It will NOT overwrite {p:Dream Shroud}'s bonuses.
** **Hellsnap**: AoE Stun. No damage taken. Causes King Goldemar to summon one of his weapons at random, note that if he uses this twice in a very short period he will not summon a second weapon.
** **Necrobane**: AoE Paralyze. No damage taken.
** **Necropurge**:AoE Curse. No damage taken.
** **Thundris Shriek**: AoE terrorize with moderate damage taken. Goes through shadows. Triggers intimidation, presumably the intimidation effect increases with each use of Thundris Shriek.
* All of the weapons can use Dire Whorl, a slight physical AoE. In addition to that, each weapon has its own quirk.
** Demonic Rod casts high level white magic. Including {s:Cure V}.
** Living Staves casts high level black magic. Including ancient magic and tier 3-ga spells, but at normal casting speed.
** Bloody Daggers attacks with little to no delay.
** Cursed Axe attacks extremely slowly, but always scores a critical hit.
** Magic Shields only use Dire Whorl and Shield Bash. They do not attack.
* Dire Whorl is blinkable by 2 shadows, if it manages to hit, it will stun you.

